Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.49,Title,,0,0,100,,{\an8\fad(750,750)}溫柔飄落的回憶之雪
Dialogue: 5,0:00:00.76,0:00:04.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,喂！喂喂喂！騙人布！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,你在哪裡啊，騙人布？！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.76,0:00:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:10.61,0:00:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,咦？他不在上面嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:00:13.89,0:00:15.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:15.51,0:00:16.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.57,0:00:19.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.12,0:00:21.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,你在哪裡啊，騙人布？！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,喂，他在叫你呢。
Dialogue: 5,0:00:24.04,0:00:27.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,唔、唔⋯⋯我現在哪有臉出去啊。
Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.38,0:00:30.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,我是認真的！快出來！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:31.71,0:00:34.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,你再不出來的話，\N我就揍扁你！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:34.06,0:00:35.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,我們揍扁你！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:36.42,0:00:40.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,喂，你知道騙人布在哪裡嗎，狙擊王？\N我到處都找不到他！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:40.99,0:00:45.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,別、別擔心。\N他在我們之前就坐小船離開了。
Dialogue: 5,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.05,0:00:48.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,為什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:00:48.44,0:00:51.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,可是這艘船現在是屬於他的啊。
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.40,0:00:56.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,他們怎麼可能認不出那就是騙人布？
Dialogue: 5,0:00:59.11,0:01:00.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,這裡也沒有。
Dialogue: 5,0:01:02.09,0:01:04.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 5,0:01:07.64,0:01:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,果然跟我們想的一樣，\N這艘船上哪裡都沒有人。
Dialogue: 5,0:01:10.30,0:01:12.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,好奇怪。
Dialogue: 5,0:01:12.34,0:01:15.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,到底是誰把這艘船開過來的呢？
Dialogue: 5,0:01:15.00,0:01:19.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,可是我們都聽到了同一個聲音在呼喚我們。
Dialogue: 5,0:01:19.86,0:01:21.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,你們也聽到了嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:01:21.48,0:01:24.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,是的，確實有人在呼喚我們。
Dialogue: 5,0:01:24.14,0:01:28.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,我不是說了嗎，\N那是梅利的聲音！
Dialogue: 5,0:01:29.40,0:01:31.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,什麼？！真的嗎？！
Dialogue: 5,0:01:33.57,0:01:36.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,對吧，梅利？！你說點什麼啊！
Dialogue: 5,0:01:36.50,0:01:39.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,你這白痴。船怎麼可能會說話。
Dialogue: 5,0:01:39.80,0:01:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,一開始我也有那種感覺，
Dialogue: 5,0:01:45.11,0:01:49.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,但那種事應該是不可能的吧？
Dialogue: 5,0:01:59.82,0:02:01.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,有一艘船正朝我們駛來！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:01.81,0:02:03.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,什、什麼？！那是誰？！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:05.40,0:02:06.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,是草帽一夥！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:06.74,0:02:07.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,他們還活著！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:07.81,0:02:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,你們沒事吧！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:10.58,0:02:12.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,卡雷拉公司的船？
Dialogue: 5,0:02:12.82,0:02:14.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,太厲害了！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:14.16,0:02:16.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,他們在Aqua Laguna期間衝了出去，\N居然還能平安回來！真不敢相信！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:18.59,0:02:21.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,他們從司法之島回來了！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:22.78,0:02:25.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,啊喂，冰老大！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:25.87,0:02:27.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,蠢山。
Dialogue: 5,0:02:29.99,0:02:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,妮可·羅賓。
Dialogue: 5,0:02:37.27,0:02:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,真是一群瘋子。
Dialogue: 5,0:02:39.61,0:02:41.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,他們向世界政府宣戰⋯⋯
Dialogue: 5,0:02:48.25,0:02:51.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,而且真的把一切都奪回來了。
Dialogue: 5,0:03:06.50,0:03:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,梅利！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:09.96,0:03:11.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,看！他們的船！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:12.39,0:03:14.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,喂，怎麼回事？！\N突然之間發生了什麼事？！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:14.63,0:03:18.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,突然之間？這不是很自然嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:03:18.26,0:03:19.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 5,0:03:20.26,0:03:24.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,梅利已經被判定無法再繼續航海了。
Dialogue: 5,0:03:24.19,0:03:25.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,可是！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:26.93,0:03:28.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,梅利！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:33.80,0:03:37.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,老大！不好了！梅利有危險了！\N你想想辦法啊！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:37.65,0:03:40.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,你們來得正好！\N你們都是船匠對吧？！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:40.95,0:03:43.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,求求你們了！請想想辦法！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:43.45,0:03:46.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,她是我們的夥伴，跟我們一起旅行了這麼久！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:46.12,0:03:49.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,而且剛才她還救了我們！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:49.45,0:03:51.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,拜託了，老大！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:54.08,0:03:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,那就讓她⋯⋯
Dialogue: 5,0:03:58.11,0:03:59.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,安息吧。
Dialogue: 5,0:04:03.50,0:04:06.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,我已經做了一切能做的了。
Dialogue: 5,0:04:15.74,0:04:17.57,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,那是什麼聲音？
Dialogue: 5,0:04:22.00,0:04:24.36,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,有人在廢料島上嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:04:28.18,0:04:31.47,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,這不是草帽一夥的船嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:04:33.88,0:04:37.38,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna造成的損害讓她傷得很嚴重。
Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.79,0:04:42.88,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,不，暴風雨之前她就已經是這樣了。
Dialogue: 5,0:04:44.45,0:04:45.84,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,我想出海。
Dialogue: 5,0:04:48.10,0:04:49.06,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,剛才那是什麼？
Dialogue: 5,0:04:54.14,0:04:57.31,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,我想最後再出海一次！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:24.00,0:05:26.27,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,我在做什麼？
Dialogue: 5,0:05:26.27,0:05:28.51,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,這艘船已經沒有希望了。
Dialogue: 5,0:05:29.80,0:05:32.18,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,冰山先生！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:32.74,0:05:36.73,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,你在那裡做什麼？！\N又有大浪要來了！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:43.17,0:05:44.62,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,謝謝你。
Dialogue: 5,0:06:08.05,0:06:10.09,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,什麼？！你想出海？！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:10.39,0:06:12.05,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,暴風雨還沒有停啊！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:12.74,0:06:14.31,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,就算只有我一個人也要去。
Dialogue: 5,0:06:14.31,0:06:15.69,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:15.69,0:06:18.36,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,那我們不能讓你一個人去！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.00,0:06:23.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,我現在正在見證一個奇蹟：
Dialogue: 5,0:06:24.38,0:06:28.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,一艘早已超越極限的船\N所展現的奇蹟。
Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.41,0:06:33.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,在我多年的船匠生涯裡，
Dialogue: 5,0:06:34.47,0:06:37.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,從未見過如此了不起的海賊船。
Dialogue: 5,0:06:39.29,0:06:41.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,她度過了精彩的一生。
Dialogue: 5,0:06:49.42,0:06:51.97,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,大家，我們回去吧！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:55.14,0:06:57.91,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,回到冒險的大海上！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:58.69,0:07:01.15,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,梅利！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.40,0:07:04.69,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,我來接你了！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.20,0:07:22.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,我明白了。
Dialogue: 5,0:08:20.76,0:08:24.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,那麼，你們準備好了嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:08:24.06,0:08:25.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,嗯。
Dialogue: 5,0:08:26.06,0:08:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,嗯。
Dialogue: 5,0:08:32.78,0:08:36.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,梅利，海底又黑又寂寞，
Dialogue: 5,0:08:36.90,0:08:39.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,我們會陪你到最後。
Dialogue: 5,0:08:43.00,0:08:46.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,騙人布不在這裡也許是件好事。
Dialogue: 5,0:08:46.00,0:08:49.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,他不可能⋯⋯承受得了的。
Dialogue: 5,0:08:50.26,0:08:52.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,有什麼想說的嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:08:52.00,0:08:53.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,我不同意。
Dialogue: 5,0:08:54.50,0:08:58.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,人總有一天要道別的。\N這是男子漢的離別。
Dialogue: 5,0:08:58.06,0:09:00.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,我絕不能流一滴眼淚。
Dialogue: 5,0:09:05.60,0:09:08.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,他也做好準備了。
Dialogue: 5,0:09:39.15,0:09:44.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,你載著我們走了這麼遠。\N謝謝你，梅利。
Dialogue: 5,0:09:56.92,0:09:57.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,下雪了！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:09.69,0:10:10.99,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,一艘卡拉維爾帆船！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:10.99,0:10:12.63,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,耶嘿！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:16.46,0:10:20.80,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,現在海賊船\N前進梅利號正式完成了！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:21.39,0:10:24.80,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,為我們的新船和新夥伴乾杯！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:34.34,0:10:36.96,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,你看看這個！\N梅利受了不少損傷啊！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:36.96,0:10:39.24,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,操作帆船的時候，\N每個人都要盡自己的責任！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.24,0:10:41.00,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,你們要記住！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:41.00,0:10:42.00,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,是，夫人。
Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.37,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,我知朵了。
Dialogue: 5,0:10:44.67,0:10:47.43,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,你們在幹嘛？
Dialogue: 5,0:10:47.43,0:10:49.52,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,練習大砲！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:49.52,0:10:51.25,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,它們飛得真不怎麼樣啊！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:51.25,0:10:53.96,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,我說了，讓我試試！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:56.46,0:10:59.92,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,太厲害了！你第一發就打中了！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.92,0:11:03.64,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,哇！我真的第一發就打中了！
Dialogue: 5,0:11:17.39,0:11:20.78,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,索隆！喂！那是我的位子！
Dialogue: 5,0:11:21.70,0:11:24.78,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,偉大航道的入口\N就在那道光的另一邊。
Dialogue: 5,0:11:26.18,0:11:29.12,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,為了找到All Blue！
Dialogue: 5,0:11:30.19,0:11:31.96,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,為了成為海賊王！
Dialogue: 5,0:11:33.00,0:11:34.79,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,為了成為最強的劍士！
Dialogue: 5,0:11:35.90,0:11:38.55,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,為了畫出世界地圖！
Dialogue: 5,0:11:39.00,0:11:43.26,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,為、為了成為勇敢的海上戰士！
Dialogue: 5,0:11:45.33,0:11:48.66,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,前往偉大航道！
Dialogue: 5,0:11:57.65,0:11:59.78,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,偉大航道的入口是一座山！
Dialogue: 5,0:12:00.75,0:12:01.99,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,山？
Dialogue: 5,0:12:17.95,0:12:20.55,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,我們做到了！
Dialogue: 5,0:12:20.88,0:12:23.68,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,這就是世界上最偉大的海！
Dialogue: 5,0:12:24.76,0:12:27.41,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,繼續前進！
Dialogue: 5,0:12:50.99,0:12:52.50,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,我們要飛出去了！
Dialogue: 5,0:12:53.25,0:12:57.91,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,不要回頭！\N我們一直往前衝！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:05.49,0:13:07.59,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,讓我加入你們的船員吧。
Dialogue: 5,0:13:07.92,0:13:11.20,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,我無處可去，\N也沒有能稱為家的地方。
Dialogue: 5,0:13:11.20,0:13:13.42,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,所以讓我留在這艘船上。
Dialogue: 5,0:13:13.42,0:13:16.92,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,噢，這樣啊。那我們也沒辦法了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:17.50,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,好吧。
Dialogue: 5,0:13:17.50,0:13:18.48,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:19.38,0:13:21.53,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,這艘船的航海士是誰？！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:22.20,0:13:24.49,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,我們在飛！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:24.49,0:13:28.68,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,太酷了！船在飛！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.12,0:13:35.41,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,那是空島！
Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.44,0:14:58.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,對不起，
Dialogue: 5,0:15:06.36,0:15:09.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,我想要載你們走得更遠的。
Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.18,0:15:13.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,對不起，
Dialogue: 5,0:15:13.72,0:15:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,我想要永遠和你們一起冒險的。
Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.60,0:15:19.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,梅利！
Dialogue: 5,0:15:20.71,0:15:21.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,有聲音！
Dialogue: 5,0:15:25.16,0:15:26.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,可是我——
Dialogue: 5,0:15:26.18,0:15:30.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,該道歉的是我們才對，梅利！
Dialogue: 5,0:15:31.08,0:15:33.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,我不擅長掌舵，
Dialogue: 5,0:15:33.77,0:15:36.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,所以有時候會撞上冰山。
Dialogue: 5,0:15:36.20,0:15:39.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,我還曾經把你的帆撕破了！
Dialogue: 5,0:15:41.27,0:15:46.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,索隆和香吉士一起犯蠢，\N把各種東西都弄壞了！
Dialogue: 5,0:15:46.80,0:15:51.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,騙人布每次都會修好你，\N可是他的技術不太好！
Dialogue: 5,0:15:52.51,0:15:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,所以該道歉的是我們才對！
Dialogue: 5,0:16:01.58,0:16:04.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,但是我很幸福。
Dialogue: 5,0:16:08.70,0:16:13.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,非常感謝你們\N一直以來這麼珍惜我。
Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.74,0:16:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,我真的很幸福⋯⋯
Dialogue: 5,0:16:26.75,0:16:29.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,因為有你們在。
Dialogue: 5,0:16:38.81,0:16:44.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,梅利！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:45.15,Credits,c,0,0,0,,Editing:\N Galaxy 9000\N\NTiming:\NPhosCity\N\NQuality Control:\Ndanpmss,\NGalaxy 9000,\NPepperjack,\NZenef\N\NSoundtracking:\N Halee\N\NGraphics:\N Datenshi\N\NKaraoke:\NKaitouYahiko\N\NTranslation:\NCrunchyroll,\NGaijin
Dialogue: 5,0:10:09.88,0:10:19.02,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{Every day we'd play covered in mud until the sun set}We spent every day covered in mud until the sun set
Dialogue: 5,0:10:19.12,0:10:28.22,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{It's hard to abandon those innocent days we spent}It's hard to leave behind those innocent days
Dialogue: 5,0:10:29.01,0:10:38.52,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{Even if I'm a dreamer, I'm still me}I'm a dreamer because that's who I am
Dialogue: 5,0:10:38.67,0:10:47.14,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{So things don't all have to fit together like a jigsaw puzzle}I don't need to fit in like a piece of a jigsaw puzzle
Dialogue: 5,0:10:47.76,0:10:57.04,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Just as someone's "Yes" could be a "No" to you,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:57.04,0:11:07.16,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{you'll surely always be free}You should always be free
Dialogue: 5,0:11:07.16,0:11:17.29,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{Even if tomorrow a wind passes through and breaks the puzzle}If the puzzle is missing a piece\Nwhen the wind passes through tomorrow,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:17.29,0:11:26.18,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{N}no one would blame you for that
Dialogue: 5,0:11:26.18,0:11:31.79,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{We had a dream that day}We knew we weren't wrong
Dialogue: 5,0:11:31.79,0:11:36.41,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{Our belief in ourselves}For the dreams we had before
Dialogue: 5,0:11:36.41,0:11:45.66,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{makes us able to cross the wildly surging ocean}That helps us cross a wildly surging ocean
Dialogue: 5,0:11:45.66,0:11:55.16,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{We know the pain that you hold in your heart, so...}We know the pain that's in your heart,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.16,0:12:05.04,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{If you ever depart this ship and live in a different world}so even if you were to get off this ship\Nand find yourself on the other side,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:05.04,0:12:14.95,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{In the end, we can all surely smile}you'll surely smile in the end.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:17.25,0:13:26.95,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{We continue to dream even today}We still have our dreams
Dialogue: 5,0:13:26.95,0:13:37.16,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{Carrying the feelings you entrusted with us as well}And the memories given to us
Dialogue: 5,0:13:37.16,0:13:46.20,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{We once again cross these rough seas and fight the pain}Today, we continue fighting the pain as we cross these rough seas
Dialogue: 5,0:13:46.20,0:13:54.41,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{So that our promise won't become a lie}So that our promises won't become lies
Dialogue: 5,0:13:54.41,0:14:05.37,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{And someday, to you who departed our ship and live in a different world,}And someday, to you who departed our ship to live on the other side,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.37,0:14:16.08,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{we'll deliver the completed puzzle}we'll deliver a completed puzzle
Comment: 5,0:10:08.37,0:10:09.69,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Whoa{...}!

